{"4272150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beyond The Cupola: ISS Simulator", "steam_appid": 4272150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond The Cupola: ISS Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the crew of the International Space Station, where the fate of the entire complex depends on your skills, teamwork, and ability to make decisions in real time. In space, nothing goes according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond The Cupola: ISS Simulator is a first-person simulator with survival elements and a cooperative mode that puts you at the center of the most technologically complex and dangerous environment ever created by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling of weightlessness and realistic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic tasks and extravehicular activities (EVA).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing complex situations and technical horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/59256a35712def2a8a6e093198a03a30.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=615 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/59256a35712def2a8a6e093198a03a30.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Orbit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Support: In addition to repairing systems, you will have to monitor basic needs—sleep, food, drink, and hygiene. Long shifts without rest lead to serious debuffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited Resources: Manage your electricity, oxygen, and water supplies. You need to negotiate with the crew who uses what, because resources are limited and affect all systems of the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complication Mechanics: The game starts with routine tasks, but the tension builds: from frequent minor breakdowns to cascading failures and extreme scenarios, turning the game into a heroic rescue of the station.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most experienced players, there is Hardcore mode, where there is no room for error and any failure can have irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beyond The Cupola: ISS Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the crew of the International Space Station, where the fate of the entire complex depends on your skills, teamwork, and ability to make decisions in real time. In space, nothing goes according to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond The Cupola: ISS Simulator is a first-person simulator with survival elements and a cooperative mode that puts you at the center of the most technologically complex and dangerous environment ever created by humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/d6b19eec63ccc389782c3365e68d528c.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling of weightlessness and realistic physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/a307371e512eb9e5f11d5e58b0f135d8.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic tasks and extravehicular activities (EVA).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/2887c48056eefca1eb0c03f8c6ea4aaa.mp4?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing complex situations and technical horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/59256a35712def2a8a6e093198a03a30.poster.avif?t=1787903094\" width=615 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4272150/extras/59256a35712def2a8a6e093198a03a30.webm?t=1787903094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Orbit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life Support: In addition to repairing systems, you will have to monitor basic needs—sleep, food, drink, and hygiene. Long shifts without rest lead to serious debuffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited Resources: Manage your electricity, oxygen, and water supplies. You need to negotiate with the crew who uses what, because resources are limited and affect all systems of the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complication Mechanics: The game starts with routine tasks, but the tension builds: from frequent minor breakdowns to cascading failures and extreme scenarios, turning the game into a heroic rescue of the station.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most experienced players, there is Hardcore mode, where there is no room for error and any failure can have irreversible consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are the ISS crew, where the station's fate depends on everyone. Oxygen leaks, system failures, meteorite threats — repair with your own hands and make real-time decisions. Complete missions, perform spacewalks. Experience life in orbit: in space, nothing goes according to plan.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https: